      "text": "# AI Problem–Solution–Unknown Graph\n\n**总状态栏｜2026-10-04｜Scheduler v2**\nWindows｜RTX3070 Laptop ACTIVE\n4090 Cloud RETIRED｜4080 32G PENDING_INTEGRATION\n重GPU：READY_FOR_4080\n\nSCAN → RECOVER → VERIFY → DISPATCH → WORK → UPDATE\nRecover before Create｜Verify before Expand\n\nC-INTENT：THEORY DONE → EXPERIMENT\nC-CONSTRAINT：CYCLE-01 DONE\nD-AGENCY：CYCLE-01 DONE\nE-REAL-EVAL：CYCLE-01 DONE → E-H1\nF：RESEARCH DONE → IMPLEMENTATION\n\n开工顺序：Canvas → MD → Linear → RECOVER CURRENT_NODE\n禁止重复 DONE/FROZEN；Linear→MD→Canvas→Next Action 同轮闭环。",
